      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Feet in the floor?  Or hover?  Make sure your origin point is set properly within Blender.\n\nHowever... yes it would be ideal to adjust span, or at least the IDK scale as I had suggested several months ago.  As of now IDK is apparently based on Arm span to height ratio.  Which effects how far down you can reach with your character.",
      "viewerReactions": null
