  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-04-12T21:11:12.655Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Character animations are odd when these spans are not correctly set. When feet are too long, they start clipping into the floor. Arms may attempt to travel into the body of the character or hover around them, and legs may be too close to each other. The avatar is in T-Pose so the issue is just with the IK Stance and animation transforms not having offsets.",
